	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"公式外伝『機動戦士ガンダム 鉄血のオルフェンズ 月鋼』第2期に登場のライバル機「ガンダム・ダンタリオン」が早くもHGでキット化！",
			"• 特徴的な機体デザインが、迫力ある大型装備とともに圧倒的ボリュームで再現！■関節に新機構が採用され、Tブースター装備からハーフカウルT装備状態への換装ギミックを実現！■付属のソードライフルは、ライフルモードからソードモードへの変形が可能！■初回限定同梱としてガンダムトライエイジのカードが付属！"
		],
		"en": [
			"The rival machine \"Gundam Dantalion\" that appeared in the second season of the official side story \"Mobile Suit Gundam: Iron-Blooded Orphans Steel\" has already been made into an HG kit!",
			"• The distinctive aircraft design is reproduced in overwhelming volume along with impressive large equipment! ■A new mechanism has been adopted for the joints, making it possible to convert from T booster equipment to half cowl T equipment! ■The included sword rifle can be transformed from rifle mode to sword mode! ■A Gundam Try Age card is included as a first-time limited bundle!"
		]
	},
